# Gym Auto-Booker — Southbank S&C

## Target
- **Class**: Monday 5:30pm Mobility
- **Gym**: https://app.southbank-sc.com

## API Reference

### Auth
```
POST /login
Content-Type: application/json
{"email":"andrew.mercer@gmail.com","password":"..."}
→ Sets httpOnly session cookie
```

### GraphQL Endpoint
`POST /graphql` (cookie auth, Content-Type: application/json)

### Queries
```graphql
query Classes($from: DateTime!, $to: DateTime!) {
  classes(from: $from, to: $to) {
    id classType startsAt endsAt capacity coachName confirmedCount spotsLeft
  }
}

query MyReservations {
  myReservations {
    id status waitlistPosition classInstance { id classType startsAt coachName }
  }
}
```

### Mutations
```graphql
mutation CreateReservation($classInstanceId: ID!) {
  createReservation(classInstanceId: $classInstanceId) {
    reservation { id status } errorCode
  }
}

mutation CancelReservation($reservationId: ID!) {
  cancelReservation(reservationId: $reservationId) {
    reservationId success
  }
}
```

## Key Finding
The 7-day booking restriction is **frontend-only**. The API accepts bookings for any class visible in the schedule (up to 14 days out). This means we can book immediately when new Monday Mobility slots appear.

## Monday Mobility Pattern
- `classType: "mobility"`
- `startsAt` contains `T07:30:00` (= 5:30pm AEST, UTC+10)
- Day of week = Monday

## Automation
- Browser-based booking via heartbeat check
- Script at `book-mobility.sh` (needs exec/shell access)

input.fn:
() => {
  // Get all classes and find all Monday Mobility sessions
  const from = new Date().toISOString();
  const to = new Date(Date.now() + 14*24*60*60*1000).toISOString();

  return fetch('/graphql', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
    body: JSON.stringify({
      operationName: 'Classes',
      variables: { from, to },
      query: `query Classes($from: DateTime!, $to: DateTime!) {
        classes(from: $from, to: $to) { id classType startsAt coachName confirmedCount spotsLeft capacity }
      }`
    })
  }).then(r => r.json()).then(data => {
    // Filter Monday Mobility (07:30 UTC = 17:30 AEST)
    return data.data.classes.filter(c => {
      if (c.classType !== 'mobility') return false;
      if (!c.startsAt.includes('T07:30:00')) return false;
      const day = new Date(c.startsAt).getUTCDay();
      return day === 1; // Monday
    });
  });
}

